{"id":"34c08ba68aabce9a","group":"73","path":"73/73-第三版迁移与扩充报告-2026-10-24.md","title":"第 73 本书迁移结构与本轮形式化修订报告（依据附件重建）","display":"第 73 本书迁移结构与本轮形式化修订报告（依据附件重建）","type":"review","metadata":{"type":"review","book":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)","book_abbrev":"73","label":"73-第三版迁移与扩充报告-2026-10-24","aliases":["73-第三版迁移与扩充报告-2026-10-24"],"display":"第 73 本书迁移结构与本轮形式化修订报告（依据附件重建）","depends_on":["[[73-第三版逐项账本-2026-10-24]]"],"source_id":"local-archive-review","source_ref":"supplied 73(6).zip; reconstructed inventory and current content review","source_status":"reconstructed-from-supplied-texts; no-source-pdf-reverification","reviewed_on":"2026-10-24","revision_round":"formal-domain-repair-20261024","edition_role":"third-edition-navigation"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"review"},{"key":"book","html":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"73"},{"key":"label","html":"73-第三版迁移与扩充报告-2026-10-24"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>73-第三版迁移与扩充报告-2026-10-24</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"第 73 本书迁移结构与本轮形式化修订报告（依据附件重建）"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a57e093d6b08f8f7\" href=\"?note=a57e093d6b08f8f7\" title=\"73-第三版逐项账本-2026-10-24\">73-第三版逐项账本-2026-10-24</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_id","html":"local-archive-review"},{"key":"source_ref","html":"supplied 73(6).zip; reconstructed inventory and current content review"},{"key":"source_status","html":"reconstructed-from-supplied-texts; no-source-pdf-reverification"},{"key":"reviewed_on","html":"2026-10-24"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"formal-domain-repair-20261024"},{"key":"edition_role","html":"third-edition-navigation"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>本文件补齐原 <code>73-MOC.md</code> 已引用但附件中缺失的报告。材料仅限本次提供的 <code>73(6).zip</code> 及本轮生成的修订文本；迁移结构由现存元数据重建，不宣称恢复原历史报告或重新核验未提供的源 PDF。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal A_{73},\\mathcal M_{73},\\mathcal U_{73},\\mathcal E_{73},\\mathcal L_{73},\\mathcal B_{73},\\Gamma_{73}\">\\(\\mathcal A_{73},\\mathcal M_{73},\\mathcal U_{73},\\mathcal E_{73},\\mathcal L_{73},\\mathcal B_{73},\\Gamma_{73}\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a57e093d6b08f8f7\" href=\"?note=a57e093d6b08f8f7\" title=\"73-第三版逐项账本-2026-10-24\">73-第三版逐项账本-2026-10-24</a> 的完整有限数据与定义。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m,r,\\ell\">\\(m,r,\\ell\\)</span> 是三个互异文件名标签，且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\{m,r,\\ell\\}\\cap\\mathcal A_{73}=\\varnothing\">\\(\\{m,r,\\ell\\}\\cap\\mathcal A_{73}=\\varnothing\\)</span>。其名称依次为 <code>73-MOC.md</code>、<code>73-第三版迁移与扩充报告-2026-10-24.md</code>、<code>73-第三版逐项账本-2026-10-24.md</code>。原始压缩包只有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m\">\\(m\\)</span>，其另外两条链接对应缺失的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r,\\ell\">\\(r,\\ell\\)</span>；本轮保持 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m\">\\(m\\)</span> 字节不变并补齐这两个目标。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p,v,b\\in\\mathcal A_{73}\">\\(p,v,b\\in\\mathcal A_{73}\\)</span> 的文件名依次为 <code>73-df-finite-path-closure.md</code>、<code>73-df-partial-value-conventions.md</code>、<code>73-df-finite-words-and-languages.md</code>。原始与修订后的直接依赖表已逐项比较：原有数学文件只增加 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(p,b)\">\\((p,b)\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(v,b)\">\\((v,b)\\)</span> 两条边，没有删除原边；这两条边让路径关系与部分函数图显式使用同一有序对表示。</li>\n<li>所有原有文件名和 aliases 均保留；没有删除原有文件。下式的文件集合表示本次输入、覆盖修订后的完整目录与仅含修改/新增文件的交付包；它们不把压缩容器本身算作目录内文件。数学原子的修订标记由逐项账本的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mu_i\">\\(\\mu_i\\)</span> 给出。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal F^{\\mathrm{in}}_{73}\\coloneqq\\mathcal A_{73}\\cup\\{m\\},\\qquad\n\\mathcal N_{73}\\coloneqq\\{r,\\ell\\},\\qquad\n\\mathcal F^{\\mathrm{out}}_{73}\\coloneqq\\mathcal F^{\\mathrm{in}}_{73}\\cup\\mathcal N_{73},\\qquad\n\\mathcal F^{\\mathrm{patch}}_{73}\\coloneqq\\mathcal M_{73}\\cup\\mathcal N_{73}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal F^{\\mathrm{in}}_{73}\\coloneqq\\mathcal A_{73}\\cup\\{m\\},\\qquad\n\\mathcal N_{73}\\coloneqq\\{r,\\ell\\},\\qquad\n\\mathcal F^{\\mathrm{out}}_{73}\\coloneqq\\mathcal F^{\\mathrm{in}}_{73}\\cup\\mathcal N_{73},\\qquad\n\\mathcal F^{\\mathrm{patch}}_{73}\\coloneqq\\mathcal M_{73}\\cup\\mathcal N_{73}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"|\\mathcal F^{\\mathrm{in}}_{73}|=396,\\qquad |\\mathcal F^{\\mathrm{out}}_{73}|=398,\\qquad\n|\\mathcal M_{73}|=26,\\qquad |\\mathcal N_{73}|=2,\\qquad\n|\\mathcal F^{\\mathrm{patch}}_{73}|=28.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[|\\mathcal F^{\\mathrm{in}}_{73}|=396,\\qquad |\\mathcal F^{\\mathrm{out}}_{73}|=398,\\qquad\n|\\mathcal M_{73}|=26,\\qquad |\\mathcal N_{73}|=2,\\qquad\n|\\mathcal F^{\\mathrm{patch}}_{73}|=28.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal F^{\\mathrm{patch}}_{73}\\cap\\mathcal F^{\\mathrm{in}}_{73}=\\mathcal M_{73},\\qquad\n\\mathcal F^{\\mathrm{patch}}_{73}\\setminus\\mathcal F^{\\mathrm{in}}_{73}=\\mathcal N_{73},\\qquad\n\\mathcal F^{\\mathrm{in}}_{73}\\setminus\\mathcal F^{\\mathrm{patch}}_{73}=\\mathcal U_{73}\\cup\\{m\\},\\qquad\n|\\mathcal U_{73}\\cup\\{m\\}|=370.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal F^{\\mathrm{patch}}_{73}\\cap\\mathcal F^{\\mathrm{in}}_{73}=\\mathcal M_{73},\\qquad\n\\mathcal F^{\\mathrm{patch}}_{73}\\setminus\\mathcal F^{\\mathrm{in}}_{73}=\\mathcal N_{73},\\qquad\n\\mathcal F^{\\mathrm{in}}_{73}\\setminus\\mathcal F^{\\mathrm{patch}}_{73}=\\mathcal U_{73}\\cup\\{m\\},\\qquad\n|\\mathcal U_{73}\\cup\\{m\\}|=370.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Delta\\mathcal E^+_{73}\\coloneqq\\{(p,b),(v,b)\\},\\qquad\n\\Delta\\mathcal E^-_{73}\\coloneqq\\varnothing,\\qquad\n\\mathcal E^{(0)}_{73}\\coloneqq\\mathcal E_{73}\\setminus\\Delta\\mathcal E^+_{73},\\qquad\n\\mathcal E_{73}=\\mathcal E^{(0)}_{73}\\cup\\Delta\\mathcal E^+_{73}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Delta\\mathcal E^+_{73}\\coloneqq\\{(p,b),(v,b)\\},\\qquad\n\\Delta\\mathcal E^-_{73}\\coloneqq\\varnothing,\\qquad\n\\mathcal E^{(0)}_{73}\\coloneqq\\mathcal E_{73}\\setminus\\Delta\\mathcal E^+_{73},\\qquad\n\\mathcal E_{73}=\\mathcal E^{(0)}_{73}\\cup\\Delta\\mathcal E^+_{73}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Renamed}_{73}\\coloneqq\\varnothing,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{Deleted}_{73}\\coloneqq\\varnothing.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Renamed}_{73}\\coloneqq\\varnothing,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{Deleted}_{73}\\coloneqq\\varnothing.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Renamed}_{73}\\subseteq\\mathcal F^{\\mathrm{in}}_{73}\\times\\mathcal F^{\\mathrm{out}}_{73},\\qquad\n\\operatorname{Deleted}_{73}\\subseteq\\mathcal F^{\\mathrm{in}}_{73},\\qquad\n\\mathcal N_{73}\\cap\\mathcal A_{73}=\\varnothing.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Renamed}_{73}\\subseteq\\mathcal F^{\\mathrm{in}}_{73}\\times\\mathcal F^{\\mathrm{out}}_{73},\\qquad\n\\operatorname{Deleted}_{73}\\subseteq\\mathcal F^{\\mathrm{in}}_{73},\\qquad\n\\mathcal N_{73}\\cap\\mathcal A_{73}=\\varnothing.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"|\\mathcal L_{73}|=294,\\qquad |\\mathcal B_{73}|=101,\\qquad\n|\\Gamma_{73}(0)|=64,\\qquad\n\\left|\\bigcup_{c=1}^{11}\\Gamma_{73}(c)\\right|=331.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[|\\mathcal L_{73}|=294,\\qquad |\\mathcal B_{73}|=101,\\qquad\n|\\Gamma_{73}(0)|=64,\\qquad\n\\left|\\bigcup_{c=1}^{11}\\Gamma_{73}(c)\\right|=331.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<h3 id=\"本轮修改目录\">本轮修改目录</h3>\n<p>下列文件逐个修补实际的类型、定义域、前提或语法接口缺口；有效对象上已有的数学含义保持不变。没有为了统一措辞或增加改动数量而重写其他文件。</p>\n<div class=\"table-scroll\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"表格\"><table><thead>\n<tr>\n<th>文件</th>\n<th>修改原因</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"abf2842401216bb7\" href=\"?note=abf2842401216bb7\" title=\"73-df-auxiliary-pda-semantics\">73-df-auxiliary-pda-semantics</a></td>\n<td>在 Hypothesis 中声明一步关系的两组完整配置及其分量域。</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"c3c84ebd86018553\" href=\"?note=c3c84ebd86018553\" title=\"73-df-cfg-ordered-derivation-histories\">73-df-cfg-ordered-derivation-histories</a></td>\n<td>直接在非空历史序列域内量化，并明确时间下标范围。</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"4b4cb7350d4f0995\" href=\"?note=4b4cb7350d4f0995\" title=\"73-df-cfg-tree-yield\">73-df-cfg-tree-yield</a></td>\n<td>补明有效 CFG 前提，使解析树及产出算子使用同一合法文法。</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"efcd33b278c102f5\" href=\"?note=efcd33b278c102f5\" title=\"73-df-cyk-table\">73-df-cyk-table</a></td>\n<td>声明递归区间端点为自然数，并明确分割下标的绑定。</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"2c2693f4159269f6\" href=\"?note=2c2693f4159269f6\" title=\"73-df-encoding\">73-df-encoding</a></td>\n<td>字典序前缀比较只读取两词共同存在的位置。</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"568502bf56055515\" href=\"?note=568502bf56055515\" title=\"73-df-endmarked-counter-machine\">73-df-endmarked-counter-machine</a></td>\n<td>先量化有类型的转移表，再检查向量坐标与零计数器约束。</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"812a4642483884b6\" href=\"?note=812a4642483884b6\" title=\"73-df-endmarked-multistack-machine\">73-df-endmarked-multistack-machine</a></td>\n<td>先量化有类型的转移表，再检查栈顶坐标与保底符条件。</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"25902d0bd75ea963\" href=\"?note=25902d0bd75ea963\" title=\"73-df-finite-path-closure\">73-df-finite-path-closure</a></td>\n<td>显式依赖本册统一的有序对和有限序列表示。</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"0a6da8c909717780\" href=\"?note=0a6da8c909717780\" title=\"73-df-finite-words-and-languages\">73-df-finite-words-and-languages</a></td>\n<td>补出元组、序列幂、有限积、多参数求值及整数区间列表的形式接口。</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"218e46cd4acfa714\" href=\"?note=218e46cd4acfa714\" title=\"73-df-nth-from-end-nfa\">73-df-nth-from-end-nfa</a></td>\n<td>用已在定义域内的位置见证表达倒数第 n 位，覆盖短词情形。</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"018ebd908b6f5c76\" href=\"?note=018ebd908b6f5c76\" title=\"73-df-ordered-tree-domain\">73-df-ordered-tree-domain</a></td>\n<td>将候选树域中的子节点检查限制到合法地址域。</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-14\" data-note=\"773cae915e5165f3\" href=\"?note=773cae915e5165f3\" title=\"73-df-partial-value-conventions\">73-df-partial-value-conventions</a></td>\n<td>显式依赖统一有序对表示，保持函数图与序列对象的区别。</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-15\" data-note=\"4723b54e4035a6fb\" href=\"?note=4723b54e4035a6fb\" title=\"73-df-pratt-tree-certificate\">73-df-pratt-tree-certificate</a></td>\n<td>先绑定有效树及标签；用自然数指数见证代替可能非整数的商。</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-16\" data-note=\"49440e374bb38c72\" href=\"?note=49440e374bb38c72\" title=\"73-df-random-acceptance-probability\">73-df-random-acceptance-probability</a></td>\n<td>显式声明固定字母表、有效随机机和输入词。</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-17\" data-note=\"772657e2b19db9ce\" href=\"?note=772657e2b19db9ce\" title=\"73-df-random-coin-machine\">73-df-random-coin-machine</a></td>\n<td>先绑定有效多带机，再读取元组投影。</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-18\" data-note=\"1c185b4536ca59db\" href=\"?note=1c185b4536ca59db\" title=\"73-df-random-polynomial-time-and-rp\">73-df-random-polynomial-time-and-rp</a></td>\n<td>用有效随机机量化域及见证保证概率函数调用合法。</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-19\" data-note=\"4863e6af7073a451\" href=\"?note=4863e6af7073a451\" title=\"73-df-regular-content-tree-grammar\">73-df-regular-content-tree-grammar</a></td>\n<td>候选对象通过有效树域和标签函数见证定义，避免提前调用部分树算子。</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-20\" data-note=\"4aa8d05c5e286fa1\" href=\"?note=4aa8d05c5e286fa1\" title=\"73-df-seven-tuple-ntm\">73-df-seven-tuple-ntm</a></td>\n<td>先绑定有类型的转移表，再对重构七元组调用提升函数。</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-21\" data-note=\"cd94bc0acee32218\" href=\"?note=cd94bc0acee32218\" title=\"73-df-stack-automaton-variants\">73-df-stack-automaton-variants</a></td>\n<td>语言类明确从有效栈自动机域取实例。</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-22\" data-note=\"86f675ae3180238d\" href=\"?note=86f675ae3180238d\" title=\"73-df-stack-automaton\">73-df-stack-automaton</a></td>\n<td>源栈头和目标栈头均在合法位置域内量化。</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-23\" data-note=\"2768770bc528cab8\" href=\"?note=2768770bc528cab8\" title=\"73-df-zero-error-expected-polynomial-time\">73-df-zero-error-expected-polynomial-time</a></td>\n<td>ZPP 定义先绑定有效随机机，再调用期望与概率。</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-24\" data-note=\"b2353339955c9c49\" href=\"?note=b2353339955c9c49\" title=\"73-ex-geometric-las-vegas-path\">73-ex-geometric-las-vegas-path</a></td>\n<td>几何停机例子的存在量词限定为有效随机机。</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-25\" data-note=\"95218b81d22ed54f\" href=\"?note=95218b81d22ed54f\" title=\"73-ex-pumping-converse-failure\">73-ex-pumping-converse-failure</a></td>\n<td>声明有效字母表以及三个字母的成员与互异条件。</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-26\" data-note=\"842c1db14c45597e\" href=\"?note=842c1db14c45597e\" title=\"73-thm-distinct-three-sat-padding-and-completeness\">73-thm-distinct-three-sat-padding-and-completeness</a></td>\n<td>用既有 Conj、Disj 的有限列表构造填充公式，消除语法结合约定。</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-27\" data-note=\"ff00e4aa0ef74db8\" href=\"?note=ff00e4aa0ef74db8\" title=\"73-thm-full-order-primality-criterion\">73-thm-full-order-primality-criterion</a></td>\n<td>自然数指数见证保证模幂调用在不合格候选上也有定义。</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-28\" data-note=\"cfebf3d79d57531c\" href=\"?note=cfebf3d79d57531c\" title=\"73-thm-pratt-certificate-polynomial-size\">73-thm-pratt-certificate-polynomial-size</a></td>\n<td>只对有效证书调用编码函数和长度函数。</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></div><h3 id=\"缺失记录与验证范围\">缺失记录与验证范围</h3>\n<p>两份新记录沿用原目录已经引用的文件名，因此不需要改名或改写目录链接。逐项账本覆盖全部 395 个数学原子，报告记录本次实际修订；均明确区分附件可验证信息与原始来源声明。</p>\n<p>验证覆盖文件字节差异、全部声明依赖与 Wiki 链接、依赖图无环、同名与别名冲突、各数学文件的三节结构以及 Assertion 的形式语言边界。针对改写过的短词位置、字典序、三文字填充与模幂指数作有限边界核验。有限核验不替代一般数学证明，Markdown 形式化也不等于证明助理内核验证。</p>\n<p>交付包用于覆盖原来的 <code>73/</code> 目录；其中只放本轮修改或新增的文件，未改文件沿用原包。完整依赖闭包是在覆盖后的整个 <code>73/</code> 上检查的。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"本轮修改目录","text":"本轮修改目录","level":3},{"id":"缺失记录与验证范围","text":"缺失记录与验证范围","level":3}],"links":[{"target":"73-第三版逐项账本-2026-10-24","status":"resolved","id":"a57e093d6b08f8f7","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-第三版逐项账本-2026-10-24]]","embed":false}